t", "provision": "ADD-03:p4-image/title", "reason": "Arabic form title 'إقرار المستفيد الحقيقي' on the reproduced form; heading only; the form is added by ADD-03:8.1."}, "provision": "ADD-03:p4-image/title", "state": {"activity_templates_sha256": "e03a7b9bfdb61c761a95606fb4b907ecf29aa8bd6a0a650d402c4f91c165b49f", "amendments_sha256": "05da72cc81f1eaada64d130dba484462fcc69c11cd065a2854ceb50136c40171", "assumptions_sha256": "661746332a14752fb78ad2b679490bd644b783bdae9a892a6829f458dbb1e7bc", "decisions_sha256": null, "evidence_build_id": "57d76e1ca885ba7c31034ccdcaabd98d124b5d233adcf4ba251e959076b179a8", "pack_id": "NUPA-ISTP-2026-014+ADD-03-CANDIDATE", "readings_sha256": "d5b499584ad0d6fccf3de99c11fd4a432c21068762a8f845095631c13d6141dc", "unrecorded_crops_sha256": null, "validated_stage": "ADD-02", "working_stage": "ADD-03"}, "statement_type": "disposition", "statements": ["S-F1", "S-F3", "S-A1", "S-I1"], "target": null}, {"dependencies": ["ADD-03:8.1", "ADD-03:AppA/para1", "ADD-03:AppB/para1"], "evidence": [{"crop_sha256": "94ac60f68dd525fbc7c8ac528f3b80dfc39829288f6a4e0ac73ec228bca592f4", "doc": "ADD-03", "kind": "reading", "page": 4, "unit_id": "ADD-03:p4-image/intro", "words": "نحن الموقعون أدناه، بصفتنا ممثلين مفوضين عن العضو المذكور أدناه في ائتلاف مقدم العرض، نقر ونتعهد بما يلي:"}, {"doc": "ADD-03", "kind": "span", "page": 2, "unit_id": "ADD-03:8.1", "words": "Form 4-H is reproduced at Appendix A to this Addendum."}], "id": "ADD-03/p4-image/intro", "model_rationale": "Band crops b04-full and b05-full show the Arabic opening declaration over two lines, the second line being 'نقر ونتعهد بما يلي:' ending in a colon that introduces the numbered declarations (أولاً/ثانياً/ثالثاً) below. It is form content a bidder signs; the governing-Arabic point (AppB/para1) matters to how 8.1's insertion is drafted, in another batch. Depends on interpretation S-I2, so it stays pending for a person.", "payload": {"candidates": [], "disposition": "no_effect", "origin": "assistant", "provision": "ADD-03:p4-image/intro", "reason": "Opening words of the declaration inside the reproduced Form 4-H: 'نحن الموقعون أدناه، بصفتنا ممثلين مفوضين عن العضو المذكور أدناه في ائتلاف مقدم العرض، نقر ونتعهد بما يلي:'. The words 'نقر ونتعهد' (declare and undertake) are the signatory's declaration within the form content, not an amendment of any clause; the form (with this content) enters the documents through ADD-03:8.1 ('Form 4-H is reproduced at Appendix A to this Addendum') and AppA/para1. Person to confirm."}, "provision": "ADD-03:p4-image/intro", "state": {"activity_templates_sha256": "e03a7b9bfdb61c761a95606fb4b907ecf29aa8bd6a0a650d402c4f91c165b49f", "amendments_sha256": "05da72cc81f1eaada64d130dba484462fcc69c11cd065a2854ceb50136c40171", "assumptions_sha256": "661746332a14752fb78ad2b679490bd644b783bdae9a892a6829f458dbb1e7bc", "decisions_sha256": null, "evidence_build_id": "57d76e1ca885ba7c31034ccdcaabd98d124b5d233adcf4ba251e959076b179a8", "pack_id": "NUPA-ISTP-2026-014+ADD-03-CANDIDATE", "readings_sha256": "d5b499584ad0d6fccf3de99c11fd4a432c21068762a8f845095631c13d6141dc", "unrecorded_crops_sha256": null, "validated_stage": "ADD-02", "working_stage": "ADD-03"}, "statement_type": "disposition", "statements": ["S-F1", "S-F2", "S-F3", "S-A1", "S-I1", "S-I2"], "target": null}], "state": {"activity_templates_sha256": "e03a7b9bfdb61c761a95606fb4b907ecf29aa8bd6a0a650d402c4f91c165b49f", "amendments_sha256": "05da72cc81f1eaada64d130dba484462fcc69c11cd065a2854ceb50136c40171", "assumptions_sha256": "661746332a14752fb78ad2b679490bd644b783bdae9a892a6829f458dbb1e7bc", "decisions_sha256": null, "evidence_build_id": "57d76e1ca885ba7c31034ccdcaabd98d124b5d233adcf4ba251e959076b179a8", "pack_id": "NUPA-ISTP-2026-014+ADD-03-CANDIDATE", "readings_sha256": "d5b499584ad0d6fccf3de99c11fd4a432c21068762a8f845095631c13d6141dc", "unrecorded_crops_sha256": null, "validated_stage": "ADD-02", "working_stage": "ADD-03"}, "statements": [{"evidence": [{"doc": "ADD-03", "kind": "span", "page": 2, "unit_id": "ADD-03:8.1", "words": "A new Form 4-H (Declaration of Beneficial Ownership) is added to Volume IV and to the list at Volume I Clause 9.1, to be inserted after Form 4-G. Form 4-H is reproduced at Appendix A to this Addendum."}], "id": "S-F1", "kind": "fact", "text": "ADD-03 Clause 8.1 adds a new Form 4-H to Volume IV and states that it is reproduced at Appendix A."}, {"evidence": [{"doc": "ADD-03", "kind": "span", "page": 3, "unit_id": "ADD-03:AppA/para1", "words": "Form 4-H is reproduced on the following page as issued."}, {"doc": "ADD-03", "kind": "span", "page": 5, "unit_id": "ADD-03:AppB/para1", "words": "The Arabic text of Form 4-H at Appendix A governs."}], "id": "S-F2", "kind": "fact", "text": "Appendix A states the form on the following page is reproduced as issued; Appendix B states the Arabic text governs."}, {"evidence": [{"crop_sha256": "1be21c3d011871394036ab9cac9954902e4d3964d26c54ec0d0fd091a363d641", "doc": "ADD-03", "kind": "reading", "page": 4, "unit_id": "ADD-03:p4-image/hdr-en", "words": "NORTHERN UTILITIES PROCUREMENT AUTHORITY"}, {"crop_sha256": "94ac60f68dd525fbc7c8ac528f3b80dfc39829288f6a4e0ac73ec228bca592f4", "doc": "ADD-03", "kind": "reading", "page": 4, "unit_id": "ADD-03:p4-image/intro", "words": "نحن الموقعون أدناه، بصفتنا ممثلين مفوضين عن العضو المذكور أدناه في ائتلاف مقدم العرض، نقر ونتعهد بما يلي:"}], "id": "S-F3", "kind": "fact", "text": "The page-4 image (region ADD-03-p4-r1) shows a bilingual letterhead box (authority name and tender reference in English left, Arabic right), the label FORM 4-H / النموذج ٤-ح, the Arabic title and the Arabic opening declaration, as read in the eight reading blocks; the readings are status pending."}, {"id": "S-A1", "kind": "assumption", "text": "The pending readings of the eight blocks are taken as correct; I compared each band crop with its source_text and found them to agree, but the readings are not yet approved by a person."}, {"id": "S-I1", "kind": "interpretation", "text": "The eight blocks are identification and content of the reproduced Form 4-H (letterhead, tender reference, form label, title, opening words); none of them amends, deletes or replaces any clause, table or form by itself. The form's addition to the documents is effected by ADD-03:8.1 (answered in another batch)."}, {"id": "S-I2", "kind": "interpretation", "text": "The words 'نقر ونتعهد بما يلي' in the intro block are the signatory's declaration within the form text that a bidder completes; they are not an amendment of tender text and impose nothing beyond what the insertion of Form 4-H under ADD-03:8.1 brings in. A person must confirm."}]}, "run_id": "ADD-03-host-20261004T155951Z-be2f", "ts": "2026-10-04T15:59:51Z"}
